    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2373890/extras/d21f65d1aaa878e9da0d982d6d09e4e6.poster.avif?t=1749536572\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2373890/extras/d21f65d1aaa878e9da0d982d6d09e4e6.webm?t=1749536572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2373890/extras/d21f65d1aaa878e9da0d982d6d09e4e6.mp4?t=1749536572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Origin</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a plane plunged into the heart of Samomor town, 19 children started disappearing mysteriously. To break the cycle of sorrow, two brave students, you and Jack, embarked on a quest to uncover the root cause.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2373890/extras/d5b569929616003824674546fb790eaf.poster.avif?t=1749536572\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2373890/extras/d5b569929616003824674546fb790eaf.webm?t=1749536572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2373890/extras/d5b569929616003824674546fb790eaf.mp4?t=1749536572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Anyone can be eliminated. The story changes as each person disappears</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't murder anyone, or the game will change almost completely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2373890/extras/3962c9838373ad5bb17e7760c0d10a4a.poster.avif?t=1749536572\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2373890/extras/3962c9838373ad5bb17e7760c0d10a4a.webm?t=1749536572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2373890/extras/3962c9838373ad5bb17e7760c0d10a4a.mp4?t=1749536572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Real-time combat system</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you can\u2019t just mash buttons. Every move requires careful planning, but your dog will be by your side, guiding you through every challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2373890/extras/b8cc6de2d34a652b1a17b0be6e654293.poster.avif?t=1749536572\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2373890/extras/b8cc6de2d34a652b1a17b0be6e654293.webm?t=1749536572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2373890/extras/b8cc6de2d34a652b1a17b0be6e654293.mp4?t=1749536572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft and mix your own abilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can mix different abilities to create many random variations. With over 40 abilities and 15 weapon skills, master the battles with your own crafted formula.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Other features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A complex story with many choices that can change the game's narrative completely</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Befriend and accompany humorous NPCs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a fully open world with caves, puzzles, treasures, and special challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character's appearance with 40+ pieces of equipment</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2373890/extras/d21f65d1aaa878e9da0d982d6d09e4e6.poster.avif?t=1749536572\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2373890/extras/d21f65d1aaa878e9da0d982d6d09e4e6.webm?t=1749536572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2373890/extras/d21f65d1aaa878e9da0d982d6d09e4e6.mp4?t=1749536572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Origin</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a plane plunged into the heart of Samomor town, 19 children started disappearing mysteriously. To break the cycle of sorrow, two brave students, you and Jack, embarked on a quest to uncover the root cause.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2373890/extras/d5b569929616003824674546fb790eaf.poster.avif?t=1749536572\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2373890/extras/d5b569929616003824674546fb790eaf.webm?t=1749536572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2373890/extras/d5b569929616003824674546fb790eaf.mp4?t=1749536572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Anyone can be eliminated. The story changes as each person disappears</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't murder anyone, or the game will change almost completely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2373890/extras/3962c9838373ad5bb17e7760c0d10a4a.poster.avif?t=1749536572\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2373890/extras/3962c9838373ad5bb17e7760c0d10a4a.webm?t=1749536572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2373890/extras/3962c9838373ad5bb17e7760c0d10a4a.mp4?t=1749536572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Real-time combat system</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you can\u2019t just mash buttons. Every move requires careful planning, but your dog will be by your side, guiding you through every challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2373890/extras/b8cc6de2d34a652b1a17b0be6e654293.poster.avif?t=1749536572\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2373890/extras/b8cc6de2d34a652b1a17b0be6e654293.webm?t=1749536572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2373890/extras/b8cc6de2d34a652b1a17b0be6e654293.mp4?t=1749536572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft and mix your own abilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can mix different abilities to create many random variations. With over 40 abilities and 15 weapon skills, master the battles with your own crafted formula.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Other features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A complex story with many choices that can change the game's narrative completely</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Befriend and accompany humorous NPCs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a fully open world with caves, puzzles, treasures, and special challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character's appearance with 40+ pieces of equipment</p></li></ul>",
